# Ruling 2025-04-04: the number of creatures is counted when the ability resolves. Bot1 has two Ornithopters (so it
# would deal 2), but Bot2 Bolts one in response: only 1 damage is dealt and Bot2's 0/2 Ornithopter survives. The
# Headliner was sacrificed as a cost, so the ability resolves regardless.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mountain
Stadium Headliner
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Mountain x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Ornithopter
Lightning Bolt
Island x17

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Stadium Headliner.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter#1.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter#1.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Stadium Headliner.Activate(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter#1)
[Bot1.Main2]
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Damage = 1

[Expect]
Turn = 3
Bot1.Graveyard = Ornithopter; Stadium Headliner
Bot2.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt
Bot2.Battlefield = Mountain; Ornithopter
